    "detailed_description": "\u25c6The hero's tale doesn't end with defeating the Daemon Lord\u2014this time, the stage is the bistro you've opened!<br />\r\nFive years after vanquishing the Daemon Lord, peace has returned to the world. You, the hero, have realized your dream of opening a bistro.<br />\r\nFormer companions and even past adversaries now visit your establishment.<br />\r\nPrepare meals and enjoy conversations while supporting them through their lives.<br />\r\nHowever, a new crisis looms in the shadows of these peaceful days...<br />\r\nThe time has come for your culinary skills and kindness to once again shape the world's destiny.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Game Features<br />\r\n\u30fbOver 20 unique heroines!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom a dignified female warrior to a succubus onee-sama, and an airheaded bard, a diverse cast of charming characters awaits!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbServe extraordinary fantasy cuisine<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOffer 40 different exotic dishes, from Goblin Gem Soup to Behemoth Sirloin Steak!<br />\r\nEnjoy collecting the menu items you've prepared in your culinary encyclopedia!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbEngage in delightful conversations with characters<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUncover characters' worries and hidden feelings through counter-side chats<br />\r\nDiscover surprising truths amid subtle foreshadowing in casual conversations!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Recommended for those who:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLove fantasy RPG worlds<br />\r\nWant to enjoy the relaxed atmosphere of an evening bistro<br />\r\nEnjoy both cooking and eating<br />\r\nWant to chat with cute girls<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Credits<br />\r\n\u30fbBGM and SE materials<br />\r\nHagali<br />\r\nMaou Damashii<br />\r\nConte de F\u00e9es<br />\r\nOtoLogic<br />\r\nKoh-no-Oto<br />\r\n\u30fbUI Design<br />\r\nKuusou Kyokusen",
